# Build output. Generated by `yarn build:once` (tsc) and `yarn build:gha-runtime` (ncc), and
# committed because the Actions runner executes the committed bundle, not `src/`.
#
# `text eol=lf` pins the line endings the `check-build` workflow depends on: it rebuilds on Linux
# and fails when the result differs from what is committed, so the committed bytes must not depend
# on the contributor's platform or `core.autocrlf` setting.
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses these files in pull request diffs and excludes them from the
# repository's language stats. `-diff` keeps the ~500kB minified bundle out of diff output.
lib/** text eol=lf linguist-generated=true
github-action-runtime/** text eol=lf -diff linguist-generated=true
